# StudyMate AI — Environment Variables

Copy this file to `backend/.env` and fill in your values.

```env
# MongoDB connection string
MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/studymate-ai

# JWT secret for signing auth tokens (use a long random string in production)
JWT_SECRET=your-super-secret-jwt-key-change-in-production

# Google Gemini API key (https://aistudio.google.com/apikey)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key

# Optional: override default models
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
GEMINI_EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-004

# Server port
PORT=5000

# Frontend URL for CORS
CLIENT_URL=http://localhost:5173

# Set to production in deployment
NODE_ENV=development
```

## Frontend

The Vite dev server proxies `/api` to `http://localhost:5000`. No separate frontend `.env` is required for local development.

For production, build the frontend and serve it behind the same origin as the API, or set `CLIENT_URL` to your deployed frontend URL.
